        prompt: 'Black-and-white 1986 police evidence photograph under flat flash, seen from above: a wet white woven polypropylene rice sack lying on a grey tarp on a concrete floor, its mouth tied tightly with twine that runs on to four red bricks bound together beside it, the heavy lumpy outline of what is inside pressing against the weave, a faded rust-brown stain soaked through one lower corner, a small numbered evidence card and a wooden folding ruler, grain.',
